2026-10-20T07:14:20.9812487Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9816904Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9817618Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9818325Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9819095Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9819777Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9820353Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9844212Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9847142Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9851382Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9854120Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9890841Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9892481Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9903839Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9920344Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9921760Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9937004Z PASS a discovered root CONTAINING an explicit root is dropped (explicit wins)
2026-10-20T07:14:20.9938299Z PASS an unrelated discovered root is untouched by that drop
